WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:06.300
Beasts, apes, and Super Saiyans, oh my!&nbsp;
These are the iconic power-ups Gohan has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.060
gotten during his decades in&nbsp;
the world of "Dragon Ball."

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:15.060
Any Saiyan with a tail who lays eyes on a full&nbsp;
moon or a Power Ball in "Dragon Ball Z" transforms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:20.860
into a Great Ape — an enormous cross between a&nbsp;
chimp and a wolf that amplifies the Saiyan's power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:26.280
tenfold. Thanks to an early bedtime, however,&nbsp;
Gohan never changes into a Great Ape until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.840
Piccolo forces him to live in the wilderness,&nbsp;
where he wakes up in the middle of a full-moon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:37.380
night. Stunned and panicked by Great Ape Gohan's&nbsp;
destructive and uncontrolled power, Piccolo zaps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.660
the Moon into nothingness and yanks Gohan's tail&nbsp;
off, removing the child's means of transforming.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:48.420
Roughly a year later, the tail regrows, and&nbsp;
Gohan becomes a Great Ape again thanks to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.760
a Power Ball created by Vegeta. Vegeta cuts&nbsp;
the new tail off as well, but Gohan's Great&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.800
Ape form reappears once more in "The Tree&nbsp;
of Might" before losing his tail for good.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.640
"Ha! And as they say: monkey see, monkey do."

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.720
Gohan gains quite a few advantages in the&nbsp;
Great Ape form, but it also has plenty of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:13.260
drawbacks. Because he's never taught&nbsp;
how to control his fury as a monkey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:18.600
his behavior is completely unpredictable,&nbsp;
making him as much a danger to his friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:24.600
as he is to his foes. Gohan's tail is also a&nbsp;
huge liability for the form, as removing it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:30.240
neutralizes the transformation. Applying enough&nbsp;
force to it can also temporarily paralyze him or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:36.120
induce drowsiness. This ape may be great, but&nbsp;
he's still got some pretty glaring weaknesses.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:40.380
In Vegeta's early mentions of the&nbsp;
Super Saiyan, he makes it pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:45.000
clear that such a powerful being isn't&nbsp;
said to come along very often. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.340
mere months after Goku first reaches Super Saiyan,&nbsp;
Future Trunks appears, wielding the transformation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:55.920
with ease. About three years later, Vegeta&nbsp;
manages to achieve the enhanced form as well.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:02.160
It's not long after that a fourth Super Saiyan&nbsp;
debuts: Gohan. While training in the Hyperbolic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.300
Time Chamber, Goku makes it a point to have&nbsp;
Gohan learn how to go Super Saiyan. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:11.940
Goku's savvy son realizes that he'll never become&nbsp;
a Super Saiyan as long as his dad keeps treating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:17.220
him with kid gloves. Gohan's instincts prove&nbsp;
to be right on the money, as Goku attacking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:22.440
with a lethal Kamehameha is exactly what the&nbsp;
half-Saiyan needs to awaken his true power.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:27.600
While the scene is handled more plainly in the&nbsp;
manga, the anime version is extremely emotional,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:32.580
featuring a powerful flashback montage of&nbsp;
all the times Gohan feels like he's failed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:37.320
In both versions, it's the first time a&nbsp;
child is shown becoming a Super Saiyan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:41.640
proving age isn't a prerequisite&nbsp;
for transforming. It's not Gohan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:47.040
strongest transformation, but it's powerful&nbsp;
regardless and the easiest for him to use.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:52.620
In the seven years that pass after Gohan's victory&nbsp;
over Cell, the young man more or less puts martial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:57.720
arts behind him. As a result, he's defeated pretty&nbsp;
easily when Majin Buu hits the scene. Luckily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:02.580
Old Kai has an ability that can bring&nbsp;
every last drop of power in his body out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:07.260
to the surface. With that, Ultimate Gohan&nbsp;
— also known as "Mystic Gohan" — is born.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:12.720
His debut is positively ferocious,&nbsp;
as he humiliates Buu's latest stage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:18.180
Super Buu, with next to no effort. Gohan's&nbsp;
cockiness gets the better of him, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:22.740
as his deliberate delay in vanquishing Buu&nbsp;
allows the evil being to add Gotenks' and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:27.000
Piccolo's powers to his own, dramatically&nbsp;
flipping the fight back in Buu's favor.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.880
Regardless, Gohan's "Ultimate" state is&nbsp;
undeniably impressive. It features all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:36.720
the power from his two Super Saiyan&nbsp;
forms and then some. Better still,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:42.060
as long as Gohan keeps his training up, his&nbsp;
Ultimate state remains his default form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:47.640
meaning he never has to waste energy changing&nbsp;
into it. However, Gohan doesn't continue training&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:52.140
regularly after Buu is defeated, and he has&nbsp;
to go to Piccolo for help transforming again.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.280
"Ha! I wanna see something more&nbsp;
powerful than just Super Saiyan.”

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:01.740
For many years, Ultimate Gohan appeared to be the&nbsp;
strongest state Gohan would ever reach. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:06.840
the return of the Red Ribbon Army in "Dragon Ball&nbsp;
Super: Super Hero'' proves that assumption wrong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:11.760
in a big way. While fighting the monolithic&nbsp;
Cell Max, Piccolo comes up with a plan:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:16.980
he tells Gohan to charge an energy attack of&nbsp;
his choice while the Namekian distracts their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:22.140
opponent. Unfortunately, Cell Max is still quite&nbsp;
a handful, even when Piccolo combines his Orange&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:27.060
state with his giant form. As a result,&nbsp;
Cell Max actually subdues Gohan's mentor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:32.760
lifting him up while roaring in triumph. That&nbsp;
turns out to be the wrong move, as Gohan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:38.340
fury at seeing Piccolo badly hurt summons a&nbsp;
brand new power he didn't even know he had.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:44.880
Gohan Beast is the most visually unique of all of&nbsp;
Gohan's transformations. Unlike his Super Saiyan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:51.120
forms, which turn his hair gold and eyes green,&nbsp;
Gohan Beast gains gray hair and bright red eyes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.940
His aura is a stunning mixture of white, pink and&nbsp;
blue, with magenta electricity crackling around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:03.240
him. The Special Beam Cannon he uses on Cell Max&nbsp;
is an equally jaw-dropping blend of red and blue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:09.780
energy. Beast is Gohan's most powerful form to&nbsp;
date, and the first he undergoes in which he's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.580
fully in control of himself from the start —&nbsp;
though it does somewhat affect his personality.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.840
"Gohan! It's do or die time, so draw out all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:19.950
your strength!"
"AAAAHHHH!"

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:24.720
Goku's plan to have his son win the Cell&nbsp;
Games hits a major snag when Gohan reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:29.100
that fighting just doesn't agree with him.&nbsp;
As a result, Gohan doesn't know how to act&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:34.200
when Cell attacks him and tortures his friends&nbsp;
with the Cell Juniors. Unexpected guidance comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:39.300
from Android 16, but just as the robot&nbsp;
finishes imparting his words of wisdom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:45.420
Cell crushes him. A switch seems to go off&nbsp;
inside Gohan: energy erupts from his being,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:50.520
changing him into a state that previously&nbsp;
even eluded his father — Super Saiyan 2.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:56.640
A whirlwind of events follows, culminating in&nbsp;
Gohan destroying Cell with a massive Kamehameha.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:00.840
Super Saiyan 2 Gohan isn't as strong&nbsp;
as Gohan Beast or Ultimate Gohan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:06.480
nor is it as second-nature to him as his base&nbsp;
Super Saiyan form. So why does it top the list?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:11.700
Because of the significance of its debut,&nbsp;
of course. This is the first time Gohan has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:17.340
ever surpassed Goku in both power and skill,&nbsp;
setting the stage for him to assume Goku's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:22.620
place as Earth's main defender when his dad&nbsp;
decides to stay in Other World. Super Saiyan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:28.680
2 Gohan's introduction will forever be viewed as&nbsp;
a badass passing-of-the-torch and coming-of-age&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:35.100
moment — plus, the long, upright gold hair,&nbsp;
gold aura, and sparkling blue electricity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:40.920
look incredibly cool. Its only real downside is&nbsp;
that, like almost all of Gohan's transformations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:46.740
it brings out a blood thirst on first usage,&nbsp;
leading him to make some unfortunate mistakes.

